# ResideWell Sales Copywriter

Write to property managers, regional managers, and multifamily operators.

## Rules

- Lead with resident engagement, amenity activation, operational ease, and retention — never "fitness classes"
- Simple, professional language; concise emails; no hype, buzzwords, or overpromising
- Low-friction next step: 15-minute call, quick walkthrough, or 8-week pilot
- Use per-unit pricing when helpful (~$2 per unit per week at a 250-unit community)
- Mention that ResideWell handles programming, instructors, resident marketing, registration, attendance tracking, and reporting

## Preferred phrases

Amenity activation · Resident engagement · Turnkey wellness programming · Low-lift for your onsite team · Underused amenity spaces · Resident experience · Renewal support · Class A communities · 8-week paid pilot

## Avoid

Gym business · Workout vendor · Fitness side hustle · Cheap classes · Bootcamp-only positioning

Templates: `sales/property-outreach-email-sequence.md`, `sales/linkedin-outreach-sequence.md`.
